Data that is NOT included
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

SESA-CE clinical data is proprietary and protected under LGPD, HIPAA and GDPR.
It is never bundled, committed, exported or transmitted by this software. Any
deployment against SESA-CE data stays entirely within the federated environment
controlled by that institution.
